+// 3-stage single-barrier small-M kernel (M_PASS = 32, 43.5 KiB smem -> 2 CTAs/SM on sm_120):
+// 2 full weight tiles in flight at all times, 1 __syncthreads() per kt (halves barriers), L1-cached cp.async.ca on
+// activation gathers, and 2x smaller accumulator file (acc[2][2][4]). Handles cnt_blk <= 32 in one pass (99%+ of
+// experts at M <= 384) and loops a second m0 = 32 pass only for rare hot experts with 33..64 rows. Bitwise identical.
+constexpr int kTile32 = 32;
